  "notes": "{触|ふ}れる is an intransitive ichidan verb with two main meanings: to make physical contact and to mention or refer to something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Takes ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ particle: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{触|ふ}れる\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{展示品|てんじひん}→展示品：19234_tenjihin⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{触|ふ}れないで⟦ください→ください：02899_kudasai⟧: Please don't touch the exhibits\n- ⟦その→その：00993_sono⟧⟦{話題|わだい}→話題：03793_wadai⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{触|ふ}れる: to mention that topic\n- ⟦{自然|しぜん}→自然：01423_shizen⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{触|ふ}れる: to experience/connect with nature\n- ⟦{法|ほう}→法：13620_hou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{触|ふ}れる: to break the law\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {触|ふ}れる: to touch (slightly formal, often light contact)\n- ⟦{触|さわ}る→触る：00808_sawaru⟧: to touch (casual, often implies handling)\n\nREGISTER:\nMore formal than ⟦{触|さわ}る→触る：00808_sawaru⟧; preferred in written language and polite contexts.",
